Package: drcTMB
Title: Fitting Dose-Response Curves Using the Template Model Builder
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Daniel", "Gerhard", , "daniel.gerhard@canterbury.ac.nz", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9336-3454"))
Description: Fits non-linear dose-response models, optionally with
    covariates and random effects on the parameters, using the Template
    Model Builder ('TMB'). The interface follows the 'drc' package. The
    response can be continuous, binomial, count or time-to-event data.
    Estimation is by maximum likelihood or by the posterior mode with
    priors. Effective doses and benchmark doses come with standard errors
    and confidence intervals, and benchmark doses can be averaged over
    several models.
